只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek CLI","id":"gh:1333781342","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"deepseek-harness-cli","slug":"peiyuwang54/deepseek-harness-cli","topics":["cli","deepseek","deepseek-ai","deepseek-cli","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek CLI is an open-source coding agent powered by DeepSeek that runs locally in your terminal."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"​English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"9 interface languages · 6 theme palettes · Agentic coding from plan to execution"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Note:** This is DeepSeek Harness CLI. We keep iterating in sync with the official DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s2","text":", and we look forward to your forks and stars."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Quickstart"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"macOS or Linux:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Windows:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"You can also install DeepSeek CLI with the following package managers:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then open a project directory and run `deepseek` to get started. The shorter `dsh` alias is also ava"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"en a project directory and run `deepseek` to get started. The shorter `dsh` alias is also available:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Start the Web UI with `deepseek web`:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The command starts the Web UI at `http://127.0.0.1:3080` by default and opens it in the default brow"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ser for a local launch. An SSH launch only prints the host URL because the SSH client or editor owns"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" the local forwarded address. Pass `--no-open` to run the server without opening a browser. See Web "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"l forwarded address. Pass `--no-open` to run the server without opening a browser. See Web UI guide."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Run a non-interactive task for scripts and CI with `deepseek exec`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"On first launch, paste your DeepSeek API key into the masked prompt. The key is stored by the shared"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" credential provider and never added to chat history. Use `/credentials` to inspect its source, repl"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ace it, or remove the saved value."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"For automation, set `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` before launch (`$env:DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=\"your-key\"` in PowerShe"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ll). An inherited environment value is read-only inside the CLI."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Permission modes"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Use `/permissions` during a session, or pass `--sandbox` and `--ask-for-approval` for exact controls"},{"id":"p25s2","text":". `--yolo` disables both confinement and approval prompts, so use it only in an isolated environment"},{"id":"p25s3","text":". See the CLI behavior reference and permission presets."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### MCP servers"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Use `/mcp` in a running session to inspect connected servers. For HTTP OAuth, run `deepseek mcp auth"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" <name>`. See MCP server management and the MCP client reference for transports, credentials, reload"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"s, and capability details."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Diagnose an installation without starting a profile, or install shell completion for both command na"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nose an installation without starting a profile, or install shell completion for both command names:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"`doctor` also checks shipped profile overlays and presets, the optional Web frontend asset, installa"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"tion channel, sandbox runner, truecolor, mouse input, clipboard support, and every enabled managed M"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"CP connection. MCP probes start the configured server with a 5000 ms per-request timeout; `--mcp-tim"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"eout-ms` changes it. Optional server failures and host capability checks are warnings; a required MC"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"P server failure, missing runtime asset, or unsupported Node version is blocking."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Inspect and validate a profile's installed plugin bundles without starting it:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"`source` shows the package directory and declared repository. `enable` and `disable` change the acti"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ve Cordis bundle list and take effect on the next launch; `install`, `update`, and `remove` use pnpm"},{"id":"p34s3","text":" for dependency resolution."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## What it includes"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- Code reading, editing, shell tools, web search, skills, MCP, and subagents.\n- Persistent sessions "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"with resume, plan, goal, queued messages, and automatic context compaction.\n- A Codex-style terminal"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" UI with six theme palettes and English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Arabic, French, Ru"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"ssian, Spanish, Japanese, and Korean.\n- Plugin-based profiles for terminal, headless automation, and"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"sh, Japanese, and Korean.\n- Plugin-based profiles for terminal, headless automation, and the Web UI."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Run from source"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Source builds require Node.js `^22.19` or `>=24` and pnpm `11.7.0`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"`pnpm run build` prepares the repository artifacts. `pnpm dsh web` uses those built artifacts withou"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ld` prepares the repository artifacts. `pnpm dsh web` uses those built artifacts without rebuilding."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Docs"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- CLI commands and profiles\n- Terminal UI and slash commands\n- Configuration reference\n- Architectur"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"and profiles\n- Terminal UI and slash commands\n- Configuration reference\n- Architecture\n- Development"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Report bugs in GitHub Issues."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"This project is licensed under MIT. Restored TUI code retains its BSD-3-Clause notice; see THIRD_PAR"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"s licensed under MIT. Restored TUI code retains its BSD-3-Clause notice; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Community"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- LinuxDo — <https://linux.do>"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
